===================================
{background_description}

EMPLOYEES TO FEATURE (TEXT ONLY — DO NOT DRAW ANY PEOPLE OR FACES):
====================================================================={emp_section_content}

PLACEHOLDER ZONES — KEEP THESE COMPLETELY PLAIN, DO NOT DRAW A CARD OR FRAME:
